 "description": "Use after the questions from get_assessment_questions are answered (or when the user already knows the point values). Computes per area: sum of single points, level, weighted points (Anlage 2 zu \u00a7 15 SGB XI), the total (only the higher of areas 2 and 3 counts) and the resulting Pflegegrad with today's thresholds (12,5 / 27 / 47,5 / 70 / 90), the distance to the next grade, which area would gain most, and the comparison with the thresholds of the government draft for 2027 (PNOG, not yet law). Areas that are left out count as 0 and are listed as unanswered. Inputs are point values only, no personal data. Not for children up to 18 months (different procedure; the tool then links the children page).",
